            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, if it is a wet/dry model \u2014 that is its defining capability. Remove the pleated cartridge filter and the collection bag first, fit the foam sleeve if your model uses one, and do not fill past the maximum water line. Never attempt this with a dry-only vacuum or a household vacuum; liquid reaching the motor is a shock and fire risk."
