            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. A pleated or paper cartridge soaks through in seconds, collapses, and is ruined, and while wet it chokes airflow so completely that the machine barely lifts water. Take it out, fit the foam sleeve if your model has one, and only refit the cartridge once both the tank and the machine are completely dry."
